<![CDATA[<br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">The following contact has had their email changed and their IPS Access has been removed. <br><br>Please review the contact to ensure that the following data for this Contact is correct. If this Contact needs to be re-enabled for IPS portal access please enable them in Sales/IPS Cloud.</b><br><div align="center" style=""><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><b><font color="#000000">_______________________________________________________________<br><br></font></b></font></b><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Contact Details<br><br></b><div align="left" style=""><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Name:</b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Name} </span></font><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Email:</b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Email}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Old Email: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Core_Old_Email__c}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Intel Support Owner: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Core_IPS_Intel_Support_Owner__c}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Contact Owner: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.OwnerFullName}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Account: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Account.Name}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Account Owner: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Account.OwnerFullName}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br>To go re-enable the Contact for IPS please &nbsp;<a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Contact.Id}">Click Here</a><br><br><br></b><div align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Additional System Information<br><br></b></div><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Contact Id: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Id}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>ERPM Id: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.Core_eRPM_Person_Id__c}</span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>Account Id: </b><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Account.Id}</span></font><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Account </b><font face="arial"><b>Unified ID</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Account.Core_Business_Party_Id__c}</font></div><div align="left" style=""><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Account CIM ID</b></font><b style="font-size: 12pt;">:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;{!Account.Core_CIM_ID__c}</font></div><div align="left" style=""><br><br><div align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#666666">_______________________________________________________________</font></b></font><br></div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><br></b><font color="#666666" size="1">This
